# one low note per part of my piano cell
# Bass idea inspired by Sade's punchy drums and bass (Smith,2026, The Culture Crypt)
# playNote(note, beats = ...) format from Week 03 seminar slides
# Bass line repeated 7 times (7 x 16 beats = 112 beats, about 67 seconds at 100 bpm)
for j in range(7):
 playNote(45, beats = 4)
 playNote(38, beats = 4)
 playNote(43, beats = 4)
 playNote(36, beats = 4)
